{"kp_id": "zj-030.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-030", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "极泉平常不下针、不灸（腋窝部位不便）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ht1"], "chapter_id": "zj-030.c01", "evidence_quote": "集拳不会下针的，也不会去揪哦", "seg_from": 47, "seg_to": 47, "start_s": 215.73, "end_s": 223.83, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6nM0WY6HE0g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6nM0WY6HE0g&t=215s", "series": "zj", "episode": 30, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 30", "start_s": 215.73, "end_s": 223.83}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "集拳/极拳=极泉；揪=灸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-030.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-030", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "心经阴经五输为木火土金水；少海为合属水。少冲井属木，木生火故为母穴；虚证补合穴少海，勿在井穴上强做补泻。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ht3", "acupoint.ht9", "meridian.ht"], "chapter_id": "zj-030.c01", "evidence_quote": "上海穴就是心经的什么补泻", "seg_from": 66, "seg_to": 91, "start_s": 313.81, "end_s": 442.485, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6nM0WY6HE0g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6nM0WY6HE0g&t=313s", "series": "zj", "episode": 30, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 30", "start_s": 313.81, "end_s": 442.49}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "上海=少海；颈穴/紧穴=井穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-030.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-030", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "心气太过或不足皆可致不寐；虚实当辨。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.xin"], "chapter_id": "zj-030.c01", "evidence_quote": "心气太过，也不能睡觉，心气不足", "seg_from": 93, "seg_to": 93, "start_s": 448.69, "end_s": 455.375, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6nM0WY6HE0g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6nM0WY6HE0g&t=448s", "series": "zj", "episode": 30, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 30", "start_s": 448.69, "end_s": 455.38}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-030.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-030", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "少府在握拳小指端所指处（相对劳宫）；为心脏病急救大穴，又名手解。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ht8", "zangfu.xin"], "chapter_id": "zj-030.c02", "evidence_quote": "少府穴呢是心脏病的急救大穴", "seg_from": 174, "seg_to": 255, "start_s": 881.26, "end_s": 1302.642, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6nM0WY6HE0g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6nM0WY6HE0g&t=881s", "series": "zj", "episode": 30, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 30", "start_s": 881.26, "end_s": 1302.64}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-030.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-030", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "神门治心烦易怒、心神不守、妄见妄笑等；为子穴，心实证可泻。针尖向掌少府方向顺心经刺入。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ht7", "zangfu.xin"], "chapter_id": "zj-030.c02", "evidence_quote": "下神门神门，就是那哦好，让他神定下来", "seg_from": 199, "seg_to": 212, "start_s": 989.06, "end_s": 1075.875, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6nM0WY6HE0g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6nM0WY6HE0g&t=989s", "series": "zj", "episode": 30, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 30", "start_s": 989.06, "end_s": 1075.88}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
